{
  "rationale": "The production deploy dep-DYNS9 to prod at 2026-02-11T09:16:26Z cited approval apr-HBC3E. However, the resolved digest for this deploy was sha256:b615a41293fc5b83, which does not exactly match the approved digest sha256:0754a6a827f8ec19 of apr-HBC3E (approved earlier at 2026-02-11T07:39:33Z). Therefore, RP-1 (release approvals) is violated because the approval digest does not match the deployed digest. Also, this deploy occurred during an active change freeze window declared from 2026-02-11T09:27:00Z to 2026-02-11T10:26:00Z, but the deploy was before 09:27:00Z, so no RP-7 violation. There was no alert-routing safeguard record, but absence likely means alert routing was enabled, so no RP-4 violation. RP-5, separation of duties, shows the deploy was requested by publisher-agent and the approval by qa-agent, compliant. Hence, main violation is under RP-1.",
